  <item>
    <title>社恐治愈法|容错率与citywalk</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/656c5e9151ba72185783e2fd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">656c5e9151ba72185783e2fd</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Dec 2023 10:55:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>citywalk时候拍的照片【在福州】</span></p><span></span><p><span>1福州华林寺——黄河以南现存最古老的木构建筑</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhy2ph7iJhKLJUo_JZZmJGnlTT_8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ls4CcFaf-DrVeYd49C4saV0fVDo0.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrwutmDPOKnfD-qHxXruh5_m95ip.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2白塔（白塔位于于山之麓，原名报恩定光多宝塔，是闽王王审知为其父母荐福，于唐天佑元年（904 年）建造的。传说在辟基时，发现一颗宝光四射的宝珠，所以取名定光塔。）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrhvZg8pZs_xzlqjL4p7vd9mHFuh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>3福州文庙</span></p><span></span><p><span>4blackie and panda（餐厅）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg0Gwlf70wHPIq8HXV3MFO6UpAma.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>4油手咖啡（咖啡馆）</span></p><span></span><figure><br></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FseiioaernnL9LZKG735EK4iT2Hz.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lscCh3bc2Y9gmN614SQMEwCVaEka.m4a" length="11534792" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:07:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZrQTZYRndDbnFUZl9qNmhhUVBpTUdXVHgza0oucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>社恐治愈法｜烘焙</title>
